{"a":[30,33],"h":"<p>Doğrudan doğru icra emri veremiyor 30.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"136\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 135.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 27.0 33.7 33.7 49.6 63.0 63.0 63.0 72.0 72.0 79.6 95.3 105.7 112.6\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.6 27.0 72.0 95.3 112.6 119.3\" y=\"25.4 25.4 20.3 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> o iyman eden zat - evvelâ Dünya azâbiyle tehdide girişiyor ki bunlara o va'd edilenlerdir. 32.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"106\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 105.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 16.4 24.0 30.7 37.4 37.4 44.3 51.7 67.4 74.3 74.3 82.4\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"30.7 37.4 67.4 82.4 89.3\" y=\"25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg></p><p>YEVMİ TENAD - tenadî günü, çığırışma, bağırışma günü demektir ki Kıyamet gününün bir isimidir. Çünkü o gün biribirlerine feryad-ü figan ile bağırışacaklar, yetişen yok mu diye istimdad edecekler, yahud « <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"274\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 274.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 3.0 11.3 18.0 18.0 24.7 32.3 48.0 64.6 71.3 84.0 84.0 97.6 113.3 113.3 120.0 120.0 126.7 139.6 139.6 147.0 162.7 162.7 179.3 186.0 198.7 198.7 212.3 228.0 241.6 241.6 241.6 249.0 255.7 262.6\" y=\"25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"18.0 48.0 71.3 97.6 120.0 126.7 186.0 212.3 255.7 262.6\" y=\"20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » mucebince ehli Cennet ehli Cehenneme, ehli Cehennem de ehli Cennete nidâ edecekler. 34.